 style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\"><img alt=\"Wand of Inferno\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Inferno_ea3581.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wyvern Fang\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_Fang_5eae53.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Bangle\"><img alt=\"Emerald Bangle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emerald_Bangle_1c7595.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\"><img alt=\"Small Sapphire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Sapphire_dd1560.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wyvern Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_Talisman_cf2bbf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.9<br/>December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><i>All vocations should be careful with these creatures. <b>The Wyvern Hill</b> is small but filled with many <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">wyverns</a> so you get swarmed very fast. <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 70+ can hunt here easily with nice profit.If <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knights</a> get swarmed they should use exori.</i>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> under <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 40 should be very careful because they have small hp and if they try to kill a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">wyvern</a> it is possible to run into the next spawn. Make sure that you have enough <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potions</a> with you.\nMages and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> should have some <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireballs</a> with them when they get swarmed.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Edron Wyvern Hill</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\"><img alt=\"Wyvern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_a6f445.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">515</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">795</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">144</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-90× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Wyvern Talisman (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Bangle\">Emerald Bangle</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Wyvern Fang (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Heoni\"><img alt=\"Heoni\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heoni_57efd9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Heoni\">Heoni</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">515</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Sinew\">Strong Sinew</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["a-fathers-burden-quest","fire-axe-quest"]}